WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
[Soft original electronic score]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.158
Rhythm can carry a story. It can also begin a conversation.

00:00:07.008 --> 00:00:16.996
In Puerto Rican bomba, movement and percussion respond to one another. In plena, narrative lyrics bring everyday experiences into song.

00:00:17.846 --> 00:00:23.479
These are distinct living traditions, with deep roots in Afro Puerto Rican culture.

00:00:24.329 --> 00:00:31.363
This abstract study invites further listening. Its synthetic score is not a traditional performance.

